<title>UK: Bayer VB sets $200 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer VB sets $200 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN Amro Hoare Govett and Bayerische Vereinsbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    29.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.119   PAY DATE   28.JAN.97L</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.719    SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIM US/UK//GE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
